# RunPod LoRA trainer — smoke test
#
# Submits a smoke job ({"smoke": true}) to the serverless endpoint and polls
# its status. The smoke job verifies the image wiring + S3 read/write without
# training. Requires GUAARDVARK_RUNPOD_API_KEY (from repo-root .env).
#
# Run:  httpyac send plugins/runpod_lora_trainer/smoke_test.http -a --output body
#       (from the repo root so httpyac loads .env)

@host = https://api.runpod.ai/v2/re65fdfztcmcxi
@apiKey = {{GUAARDVARK_RUNPOD_API_KEY}}

# 1. Submit the smoke job
# @name submit
POST {{host}}/run
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": {
    "smoke": true
  }
}

###

# 2. Poll the job status (uses the job id from the submit response)
# @ref submit
# @name status
GET {{host}}/status/{{submit.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
